Dialogue: 3,0:01:30.03,0:01:35.58,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(978,0)}Kuma Bear
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.03,0:01:35.58,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(978,0)\t(936,978,\1a&H00&)}Kuma Bear
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saturn of the Five Elders\Nhas made landfall. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when did he come ashore?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.12,0:01:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone but the vice and rear\Nadmirals retreat from the town center?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.52,0:01:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Retreat from beholding his holy visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's happening and\Nthey're not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the admirals don't dare\Nto question a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not just a celestial dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The elder stands above all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.88,0:02:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did he come all the\Nway here from Marie-Joan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only seen the elders\Nin portraits before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.34,0:02:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saturn, this is a grave offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've turned your blade against\Nthe highest authority in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.00,0:02:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, prepare to strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.88,0:02:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.20,0:02:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie, run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroyed our lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back, Incest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.90,0:03:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't want to get stabbed,\Nthen I would have dodged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.14,0:03:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A wasted effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.90,0:03:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the blood disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seize Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk and the others immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.54,0:03:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you worthless fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're no threat, and\Nthey have nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand at the ready! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.32,0:03:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kizaru, I expected\Nyou to settle this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:03:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.36,0:04:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid i have no excuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.54,0:04:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only my deep regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and to make matters worse,?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.62,0:04:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.92,0:04:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I see some pirates\Nknow how to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a big shot now, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the world rulers wants your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jewelry Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your appearance here was\Nunexpected and unwelcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've sealed your fate,\Nand you are surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:05:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think you can't escape,\NI'd be curious to see how...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pity you betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've made many\Ncontributions to the Marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who should I kill first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name them in order of who\Nyou will create the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to die regretting your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rebellion with every ounce of your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are humans never content?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must they crutch at the forbidden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can anybody else move? Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it ain't from lack of trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm being held down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this force?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with all my power,\NI can't seem to budge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Science can't explain this. Oh no! Bonney!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you murdered my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.18,0:06:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you also know he was\Nborn into a slave caste?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the descendant of a clan\Nthat committed a grave crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sole survivor of the Buccaneer people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.52,0:06:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a\Nchild, I've had a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.08,0:07:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.24,0:07:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who could save the downtrodden\Nand free people from suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.56,0:07:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A warrior of liberation, just like Nika!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aim for her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.06,0:07:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonney! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.98,0:07:35.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.10,0:07:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.01,0:07:38.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's only a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.62,0:07:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's a hero, does that mean\Nhe'll come and free me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he will.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.91,0:07:57.37,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\b1\bord2.5\shad1\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\4c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.7\1a&HFF&\fad(356,0)\t(315,356,\1a&H00&)\pos(1640,650)\fscx90\fscy90}47 Years Ago\NKingdom of Sorbet\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:07:54.91,0:07:57.37,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\b1\blur0.7\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\c&H000101&\fad(356,0)\pos(1640,650)\fscx90\fscy90}47 Years Ago\NKingdom of Sorbet\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're so glad you're here with\Nus. Hello, Kuma. It's Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:11.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume it's about his blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be our little secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he? Perfect. Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.70,0:08:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure looks happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.79,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\b1\bord3\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.7\1a&HFF&\pos(1675,877)}4 Years After\NKuma's Birth
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.29,0:08:38.79,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\b1\blur0.7\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\c&H000101&\pos(1675,877)}4 Years After\NKuma's Birth
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to run, Clap! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government's men are on the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.74,0:08:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They came to the hospital!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:52.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait I'm the only one of\Nus here who has buccaneer
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blood my wife doesn't let\Nher and my son go Please
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have mercy I'm the one you\Ncame here for not them don't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.06,0:09:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do this. Just take me\Nand let your family go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.86,0:09:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that, even at a young\Nage, he's quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a buccaneer's slave for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.98,0:09:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.06,0:09:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your job right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you always so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:05.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop hitting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.60,0:10:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all beat up. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.10,0:10:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, it's just a few bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you've grown up so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you've been okay, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, my master has been\Npretty nice to me, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I guess you could say I'm lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.66,0:10:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma, the truth is, your mother,\NI'm afraid that she's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.54,0:11:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that means she's in heaven now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.84,0:11:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's better that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.60,0:11:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'd be better off dead, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Warrior of Liberation will\Nsave you. Have faith. He'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika, the sun god, is a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buccaneers have told tales\Nof him for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nika's a part of our heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.84,0:11:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll show up and deliver\Nus all to freedom one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:56.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll take you to the sea\Nbeneath the free skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:11:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.14,0:12:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Nika is always laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he makes people\Nsmile with this rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, you worms!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment has finally arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a triennial game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the local hunting
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\fscx90\fscy90\b1\bord3\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.7\1a&HFF&\pos(1678,590)}38 Years Ago\NWest Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.99,0:12:42.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnRoboto\b1\blur0.7\bord0\fscx90\fscy90\c&H000101&\pos(1678,590)}38 Years Ago\NWest Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gordportation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.12,0:12:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This year's test of\Nstrength and skill is in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.34,0:12:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a land unaffiliated with\Nthe world government?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gordbelly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its name may be in poor taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the island does possess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An abundance of natural resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worthy of the divine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the first step is to hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our customary human hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when we're done, the government\Nwill seize the whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.24,0:13:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to slaughter\Nmy people for sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.60,0:13:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This country belongs to us\Nalone! Your Majesty! How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.44,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like that man one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.12,0:13:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! Now hold on!\NThis is no good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saint Garling that was\Na false start you've
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already taken down the\Nking of the locals before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've even begun your\Nmajesty Saint Garling
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:13:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a top contender but he has to start
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.78,0:14:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Negative 10 000 points the handicap\Nwill just make things more interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFEFDFD&\3c&H41CEF0&\4c&H38ACC7&\1a&HFF&\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord2\shad1.5\pos(1540,550)}St. Figarland Garling\NKnight of God
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.12,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord0\c&H010100&\pos(1540,550)}St. Figarland Garling\NKnight of God
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.18,0:14:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so dashing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite the large deficit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.62,0:14:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satisfactory indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last note before we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to the local rabbits,\Nwe've also assembled a wide selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of problematic slaves and\Ncriminals for you to hunt today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the bars. Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the slaves escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.92,0:14:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute! You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell didn't you stop him? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then take responsibility\Nand go hunt him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saint Saturn!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were able to recapture\Nthe escaped slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the buccaneer child, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.16,0:15:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, kid, you can't just\Nrun away on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to be\Nresponsible for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.80,0:15:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you get away, all ten of the\Nguys in our group will be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.78,0:15:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the star of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fucking ear boy, right? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.68,0:15:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They weren't lying when they\Nsaid you've got giant's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bro here's pretty gigantic himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just got a big head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.20,0:15:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all look so miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try enjoying\Nlife for a change?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.61,0:16:05.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFEFDFD&\3c&HFEFDFD&\4c&HFEFDFD&\1a&HFF&\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord2.5\shad1.5\fscx125\fscy125\pos(327,715)}Emporio Ivankov\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Slave
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.61,0:16:05.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010100&\pos(327,715)}Emporio Ivankov\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Slave
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.61,0:16:05.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFEFDFD&\3c&HFEFDFD&\4c&HFEFDFD&\1a&HFF&\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord2.5\shad1.5\fscx125\fscy125\pos(1572,965)}Ginny\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Slave
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.61,0:16:05.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std U Strp\blur0.8\bord0\fscx125\fscy125\c&H010100&\pos(1572,965)}Ginny\N{\fscx100\fscy100}Slave
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So stick with us and you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.50,0:16:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I choose life, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.76,0:16:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now today's prey has been\Nreleased onto the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 13 super rare rabbits we introduced\Nare worth 10,000 points each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are also 150 rare rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.14,0:16:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hit kills earn you an excellent bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.32,0:16:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the champion will receive\Nthese priceless treasures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch and learn, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.52,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get too cocky, Garp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man-liars are gonna nab that trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patience, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's follow the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you do this, you monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.78,0:16:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.70,0:17:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're human beings,\Nnot toys, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna find a way to\Npull this off, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.82,0:17:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 200 world noble hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.74,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have one hour to find\Na hoe to hide in, rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now run!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx160\fscy160\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\b1\bord2.5\shad1.5\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\4c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.8\pos(960,500)}Marine\NHeadquarters
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.36,0:17:30.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\b1\blur0.8\bord0\fscx160\fscy160\c&H000101&\pos(960,500)}Marine\NHeadquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.34,0:17:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Valley!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.00,0:17:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you gonna make me\Ntrek all the way out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just help me, Garp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.84,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't confirmed the details, but\Nwe can't take any chances with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get involved\Nin some world noble field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because they poked the hornet's\Nnest doesn't mean we should.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.36,0:17:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned you, you can't steal treasure\Nfrom Pirate Island and get away with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll get it back for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, who leaked the intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:18:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got plenty of eyes on the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you sweating for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.74,0:18:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were expecting some trouble, but we\Nnever thought that Roger would get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have led with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.94,0:18:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rock Pirates have set sail!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.37,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fscx150\fscy150\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\b1\bord2.5\shad1.5\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\4c&HFBF7F5&\blur0.8\pos(950,700)}Beehive, the Pirate Island\NNew World
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.37,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fscx150\fscy150\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\b1\blur0.8\bord0\c&H000101&\pos(950,700)}Beehive, the Pirate Island\NNew World
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards got ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta catch up! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No pirate worth his salt would miss this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.20,0:18:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without further ado, let the games begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.56,0:18:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there, on the coast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Navy's got the\Nwhole island surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an entire fleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.50,0:18:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've made sure no one\Ncan escape from this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if we can't get out and tell\Nthe world what they've done here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then they can erase their\Ncrimes from history!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.54,0:19:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're planning to kill the locals and\Nsteal the island's natural resources!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And three weeks from\Ntoday when their little
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.84,0:19:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,murder game is over every\Nlast one of the hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.84,0:19:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thousand rabbits will be\Ndead don't you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we even realized\Nit we've gone to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.92,0:19:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah but we just got to survive\Nthree weeks if we can pull
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that off we'll be free they're\Nnever going to let you go they've
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Done this before. There are no\Nsurvivors from any game. Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what if they're just gonna kill\Nus all why would they give us
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hope Because if you have hope\Nyou'll run for your lives they
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't want to kill people who\Nknow that they'll die that's no
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fun for them you can't survive\Nplaying by their rules this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.70,0:19:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sick game is rigged against us\Nso we have to turn it on its head
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,St.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garling has earned a\Nwhopping 100,000 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be aiming for high-score rabbits!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.82,0:20:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice jaws, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to have a sharkfish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not used to feel comfortable anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But neither the pirates nor the Navy have\Ndone a thing. Why not? I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.88,0:20:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I do best?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.96,0:20:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manipulating intel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just one ticket out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the prizes for the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.04,0:20:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the prizes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One is a Devil Fruit\Nwith mythical strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.62,0:20:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It lets you transform into an azure\Ndragon. They've got another one to a
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.14,0:21:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devil Fruit that gives you the power to\Nsend people flying to faraway islands
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.68,0:21:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called the pawpaw fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can eat one of those\Nfruits, we'll have it made.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll track them down, soar over the\Nblockade, and leave this hellhole in the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.06,0:21:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The prizes are at the\Ncenter of the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon as they spot us,\Nwe're done for. Don't fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a thief and a pro at wiretapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.08,0:21:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two weeks ago, I leaked some intel\Nabout this island to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means pirates will be\Nflooding this place soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll want that sweet treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be pandemonium!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, that alone won't be\Nenough to pull off our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.46,0:21:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of us will have to serve as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta distract the\NCelestial Dragons to rob them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.38,0:21:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.60,0:21:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm big and tough, so I think I\Ncan survive longer than the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I don't want\Nto see anyone else hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:21:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heehaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.43,0:22:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're talking Kuma, and\NI won't let you die either.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's escape God Valley, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming from the east!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Rocks Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.90,0:22:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rocks Pirates? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.86,0:22:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, there are others too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.58,0:22:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a whole swarm of infamous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.98,0:22:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.00,0:22:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.40,0:22:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother, you Navy dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.54,0:22:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocks Pirates, follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that, Rocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.16,0:22:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can order\Nme around? Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop it, Newgate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.42,0:22:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.26,0:23:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Planning to do something today, Stussy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.70,0:23:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk, Gloriosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.08,0:23:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finders' keepers, as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We good with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:14.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking both fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.66,0:23:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Linlin, you can't even use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.20,0:23:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're my treasure, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.62,0:23:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rox is a damn fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.34,0:23:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll forget why we're even here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's run in and check the treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop talking like you are\Na leader, you hypocrite!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm about to wreck this whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your head out of the clouds\Nand quit trying to act tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's grab the treasure\Nand take to the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.38,0:23:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that Roger\Nmight be showing up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.98,0:23:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I just say, you brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.92,0:23:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight will decide it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.58,0:23:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what we want, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.04,0:23:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.58,0:23:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rocks pirates have made landfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.08,0:23:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pirates here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.38,0:23:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you defense doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.90,0:24:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to\Nus, we'll see you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.18,0:24:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dangerous pirates are\Ncoming from all directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.10,0:24:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they know?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This event was strictly confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.52,0:24:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their current objective is unclear.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.72,0:24:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.84,0:24:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the western shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.08,0:24:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Roger pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.24,0:24:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a whole year, you have any idea\Nhow much I've been stewing on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.18,0:24:30.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gonna be a wild one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.94,0:24:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger, no calling first dibs!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.40,0:24:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just because you're the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull back the marines.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect the celestial dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:42.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was the point of the blockade?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.08,0:24:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy night to battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.96,0:24:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.10,0:24:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger and rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.76,0:24:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.72,0:24:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold out. A
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.88,0:25:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,piece
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.26,0:25:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of Roger
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a Devil Fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.36,0:25:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.27,0:25:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got no idea which is which, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.98,0:25:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.70,0:25:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.08,0:25:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.72,0:25:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eva, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for my other treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.06,0:25:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better fork that over\Nnow, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.42,0:25:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't think twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat that fruit and survive, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.06,0:25:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one of us has to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.90,0:26:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single survivor means we win!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.04,0:26:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.52,0:26:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, Kuma, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.80,0:26:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, buccaneer boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.04,0:26:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will live as a\Nslave, then you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.44,0:26:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is your lot in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.02,0:26:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your fate has been decided\Nby the course of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.54,0:26:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's someone important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says some people are born to rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.32,0:26:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.68,0:26:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some people are born to be slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.52,0:26:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we born at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.02,0:26:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.52,0:26:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I really do have some\Npower, Then I want to be like Mock.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.58,0:26:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to protect people from suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.52,0:27:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to free as many slaves as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.42,0:27:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.04,0:27:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your people need to be eliminated!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.44,0:27:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of my way, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.72,0:27:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This incident would fade into\Nthe dark shadows of history.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.16,0:27:22.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fscy85\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\bord2\shad1.5\blur0.7\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,1442,1,\c&HFBF7F5&\3c&HFBF7F5&\4c&HFBF7F5&)\pos(1648,575)}Kingdom of Sorbet\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.16,0:27:22.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fscy85\fnFOT-Seurat ProN DB Strp\blur0.7\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\t(0,1442,1,\c&H000101&)\pos(1648,575)}Kingdom of Sorbet\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.72,0:27:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wrote about Garp's heroics,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.90,0:27:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but didn't mention anything\Nelse that happened that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.48,0:27:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people in power\Nwrite our history for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This reporter Morgans\Nis nothing but a hack!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were there, and we might\Nnever learn the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do is hope and pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to\Nkeep doing that, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.78,0:27:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm praying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.46,0:27:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all the lives that\NI wasn't able to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.42,0:27:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.94,0:27:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in all that chaos,\Nyou saved 500 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.04,0:27:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right, Kumaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.34,0:27:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.74,0:27:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were all so grateful that they cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.04,0:27:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that I cried too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.22,0:28:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.46,0:28:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those hands can do more than pray.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.62,0:28:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're the hands of liberation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Liberation?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.42,0:28:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.72,0:28:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just have to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.58,0:28:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warrior of liberation will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.32,0:28:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So your family ran a church\Nwhen you were born, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.14,0:28:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that would explain\Nwhy you turned out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.86,0:28:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.77,0:28:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, pals!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out to sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.14,0:28:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm free now, so I gotta enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.16,0:28:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I get that one a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.36,0:28:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bro, I still gotta figure out my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.00,0:28:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stay with Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.36,0:28:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.84,0:28:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my darling compatriots.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.92,0:28:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.52,0:28:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the eldest here by four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.54,0:29:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that means it's my job to keep you fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.60,0:29:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.28,0:29:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking good!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.68,0:29:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.56,0:29:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more scavenging.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.34,0:29:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.66,0:29:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll work for our food, honest-like.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.04,0:29:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's head off to market. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.64,0:29:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We sold it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.68,0:29:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked up an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.84,0:29:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want to eat today?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.24,0:29:36.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine with anything.\NYou can pick. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.30,0:29:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dadan?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.00,0:29:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen you two around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.68,0:29:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.59,0:29:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.51,0:29:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure are huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.84,0:29:45.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.06,0:29:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm big, but I'm nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.66,0:29:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.40,0:29:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.84,0:29:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.44,0:30:10.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, we got off to a bad start.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.84,0:30:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jimmy is usually nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.22,0:30:17.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bump's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt anymore. It's magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.34,0:30:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was so cool, Kumachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.78,0:30:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumanshee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.69,0:30:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kumanshee! Kumanshee!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.98,0:30:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.30,0:30:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't gotta tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.12,0:30:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want more! Here. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.64,0:30:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay if you want to eat a\Nlot, but we'll have to work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.20,0:30:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.04,0:31:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, what age\Ndid you become a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.26,0:31:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was four.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.06,0:31:11.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know if that's something\Nfor you to smile about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.26,0:31:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm four.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.72,0:31:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm four. Hmm? Ginny?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.36,0:31:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ginny!
